  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\">ПВП ПРИЦЕЛ</strong></span></span></h1><h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>АНГЛИЙСКИЙ</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>Текстурный пакет с пользовательским прицелом для Minecraft PVP Pro.</strong></span></p><h4><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>С этим прицелом вы сможете улучшить свои навыки в бою, поскольку он не мешает и обеспечивает высокую точность.</strong></span></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>Содержит:</strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; - Пользовательский прицел</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1151043/description_ffdc58dd-b65c-4879-a1c5-c30b7a724107.png\" width=\"118\" height=\"124\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; От @d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>БОЛЬШЕ ПРИЦЕЛОВ:</strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">V1 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">(ПОПУЛЯРНО)</span></a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair-v2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">V2</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair-v3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">V3</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair-v4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">V4</a></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair-v5\" rel=\"nofollow\">V5</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair-v6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">V6</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/crishmas-crosshair\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">CRISHMAS</span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">EDITION</span></a></strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\"></p><h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>ИСПАНСКИЙ</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>Пакет текстур с настраиваемым прицелом для профессионального PvP в Minecraft.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>С этим прицелом вы сможете улучшить свои навыки в бою, так как он не мешает и обеспечивает высокую точность.</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>Содержит:</strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - Настроенный прицел</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1151043/description_a91f720a-1f75-4de6-85d4-657df151f3f6.png\" width=\"107\" height=\"113\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>От @d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>БОЛЬШЕ ПРИЦЕЛОВ:</strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">V1 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">(ПОПУЛЯРНО)</span></a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair-v2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">V2</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair-v3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">V3</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair-v4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">V4</a></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair-v5\" rel=\"nofollow\">V5</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pvp-crosshair-v6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">V6</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/crishmas-crosshair\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">CRISHMAS</span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">EDITION</span></a></strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>❤️ Поддержите меня ❤️</strong></h2><p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wURmd9P3qq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"180\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252f